  "resume": "Jonathan Segovia earned an M.S. in Software Engineering at Mapletree Academy from 2016 to 2018, and a B.S. in Computing at Raincourt College from 2012 to 2016. I received the Raincourt Community Builder Award in 2021. My skills include TypeScript, React, Python, and accessibility testing.",
