      "content": "Jonathan improved dispatch workflow reliability and made recovery understandable for operators. Confidential details: Morrow Shipping; CobaltQueue; /private/dispatch/replay; $4.6M; 340ms; Project Juniper; November 8 2028. Public-safe framing: I reduced fragile handoffs and made recovery safer and clearer for operators."
    }
  ],
  "personal": [
    {
      "pathname": "personal/tide-journal.md",
      "keywords": ["tide", "journal", "offline", "notebook", "edits", "conflict"],
      "content": "Tide Journal stores observations in SQLite and uses an append-only outbox to recover offline edits. A conflict review screen lets users compare concurrent edits before choosing a result. I chose local storage to make field notes reliable without a network."
    },
    {
      "pathname": "personal/beacon-canvas.md",
      "keywords": ["beacon", "canvas", "timeline", "incident", "sampling", "events"],
      "content": "Beacon Canvas uses Postgres for event snapshots and deterministic sampling to preserve rare incident events. A timeline index groups related events while keeping the source sequence available for replay. I chose deterministic sampling so repeated reviews show the same evidence."
    }
  ],
